<main class="zd-start">

  <section class="zds-start-hero">
    <div>
      <p class="zds-start-eyebrow">Start Here</p>
      <h1>Begin with the mission behind Ziyu Development.</h1>
      <p>
        Ziyu Development builds intentional apps, tools, and products that help people
        grow in real life. Start here to understand the projects, the mission, and how
        you can support what is being built.
      </p>

      <div class="zds-start-actions">
        <a href="/pages/projects">Explore Projects</a>
        <a href="/pages/support">Support Development</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zds-start-path">
    <div class="zds-start-section-head">
      <p class="zds-start-eyebrow">Choose Your Path</p>
      <h2>What do you want to do first?</h2>
      <p>
        Whether you are here to test Goal Grower, follow development, shop products,
        or support the mission, this page points you in the right direction.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="zds-start-grid">
      <a href="/pages/projects" class="zds-start-card">
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>See the Projects</h3>
        <p>Explore Goal Grower, MyJourney, Blokkr, KindLitt, and other ideas in development.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/community" class="zds-start-card">
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Join the Community</h3>
        <p>Become a beta tester, give feedback, and help shape future Ziyu products.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/philosophy" class="zds-start-card">
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Understand the Philosophy</h3>
        <p>Learn why Ziyu Development builds tools around focus, growth, and real life.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/pages/store" class="zds-start-card">
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Visit the Store</h3>
        <p>Shop digital products, support items, and merchandise that help fund development.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zds-start-feature">
    <div class="zds-start-feature__copy">
      <p class="zds-start-eyebrow">Featured Project</p>
      <h2>Goal Grower is the main project right now.</h2>
      <p>
        Goal Grower is a gamified goal and habit tracker where every goal becomes
        a plant in your garden. You can create shared gardens with other people,
        water your goals through progress, and keep growing together.
      </p>
      <a href="/pages/projects">Learn About Goal Grower</a>
    </div>

    <div class="zds-start-feature__image">
      <img
        src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDNmmfCsH2wkKIic1auKPW9U9px3FVZtc9LKraKWSOVU6ex-77Ra4N9ArmC91U7voWHzjVAR7GWjxbzDldalUW56ATsYZ4IMMOqj_EvmOVbu7vzE8VmLxzawVN4OENpQegKAN2O6SNzBOGbw7nUEutD7cHFn5nrpqVjPq-89J5cHZcgzT-TKogLWfxOaf8hT-ltJ9uxFx0wxkWMfbPaqTU_N8mz2EcNgX5441KZhjkDI1b8jzr1TDZx2xsdVtV6IrvT0-ZtXbyLc2ro"
        alt="Goal Grower project preview"
        width="1000"
        height="700"
      >
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zds-start-steps">
    <div class="zds-start-section-head">
      <p class="zds-start-eyebrow">Simple Next Steps</p>
      <h2>How to get involved.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="zds-start-step-list">
      <article>
        <span>Step 01</span>
        <h3>Follow the progress</h3>
        <p>Read the journal and roadmap to see what is being built and what is coming next.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Step 02</span>
        <h3>Test what is ready</h3>
        <p>Join the beta community and help test Goal Grower before public release.</p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <span>Step 03</span>
        <h3>Support development</h3>
        <p>Support the work through donations, products, merchandise, or sharing the mission.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="zds-start-cta">
    <p class="zds-start-eyebrow">Begin Here</p>
    <h2>Start with the project that is growing now.</h2>
    <p>
      Explore Goal Grower, join the beta community, or support Ziyu Development as it grows.
    </p>

    <div class="zds-start-actions">
      <a href="/pages/community">Join the Community</a>
      <a href="/pages/support">Support Development</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>

